OL,3,ATrump says more US attacks on Iran
OL,4,A'highly unlikely'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAddressing reporters from the White
OL,7,FHouse press briefing room, Trump said
OL,8,Fthat renewed US attacks on Iran were
OL,9,F"highly unlikely" but that the US was
OL,10,F"locked and loaded" should the
OL,11,Fcircumstances change.
OL,13,FIranian officials have repeatedly
OL,14,Fexpressed doubts about Trump's prior
OL,15,Fcomments about resolving the conflict.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
